private/secret/api/auth/signing/access. `pubkey`, `monkey` and the
rest of the `*key` tail stay allowed; a denied value still never
reaches stdout or the log.

`system env-names --names` uppercased each requested name before
matching, so a lowercase query could never match its own variable —
